        },
        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity / retail-vs-algorithm",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "A small cohort of algorithmic traders captures most profits while retail participants consistently lose, making the platform's liquidity depth dependent on continued institutional participation.",
